🔥ANR [Application not responding]
It Occur when main thread is blocked for more than 5 sec

🔸Why ANR
Network/File or long running task in main thread

🔸Avoid
1-Never perform network/ file or database operation in main Thread
2-use coroutine,workManager or flow


